OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying fine
OL,6,Fand dry this evening, with cloud
OL,7,Fspreading in from the north later
OL,8,Fwhich might bring the odd shower to
OL,9,Fnorthern parts. Cloud will gradually
OL,10,Fpush southward through the early hours
OL,11,Fwith clear spells to follow.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FA cloudy start in the south
OL,14,Fbut this will gradually clear, leaving
OL,15,Fa fine and sunny day across the
OL,16,Fregion. Feeling warm in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
