OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FDry
OL,6,Fover the next few days with plenty of
OL,7,Fsunshine. Turning hotter through the
OL,8,Fweek, and increasingly humid from mid-
OL,9,Fweek with light winds.
